      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Project Raising Reefs is a combined kapatiran effort of the shorline and
    ocean communities of the Philippines. They focus their efforts in educating the
    masses on the dangers of certain fishing practices.


    Part of their program,
    is a coral regrowth and replanting effort to repair already damaged ecosystems.
    This is to help the local fishing population grow back from their scarcity, providing
    new homes and hiding places for plenty of marine life.


    Project Raising
    Reef has restored over 1000 square kilometers of ocean reefs since its founding
    2007.


    Consider Supporting Project Raising Reefs by donating!


    Or


    Consider
    Subscribing to our newsletter to stay up to date!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
