  m_text: "From comfort food to quick cravings, Order Corner\u2019s top vendors consistently
    deliver delicious meals right to your door. \n\nWings Galore remains a crowd
    favorite with its bold flavors and generous servings, \n\nwhile Lucky Bowls brings
    warm, hearty rice meals perfect for busy days. \n\nIf you\u2019re craving something
    classic, BestFriendsForever offers reliable homestyle dishes that never disappoint.\n\nAnd
    for a sweeter touch, Milky Way serves refreshing drinks and desserts that complete
    any meal."
