  m_text: "Good Day Kevin!\n\nWe'd like to congratulate you on making it this far
    into the the application process!\n\nWe have just a few more steps to determine
    if you're the right fit to be our intern at Silly String Studio! \n\nWe would
    like to set up a face-to-face interview with you at our office on 11am Thursday,
    November 27. \n\nLet us know if there is a conflict with your schedule and we
    can arrange a different date."
