  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "If you\u2019re looking to create tasty meals without spending too much,
    these three fish are perfect for budget-friendly cooking. \n\nTilapia is widely
    available, quick to prepare, and pairs well with nearly any seasoning. \n\nBangus
    (milkfish) offers rich flavor at an accessible price, especially in Filipino
    households. \n\nAnd for light, versatile dishes, Mackerel provides great nutrition
    and a satisfying taste without stretching your wallet. \n\nSimple, affordable,
    and delicious\u2014these fish prove you don\u2019t need a big budget to enjoy
    good food.\n\nAside from affordability, these fish are also packed with nutrients
    like omega-3 fatty acids, protein, and essential vitamins. \n\nThis makes them
    excellent choices for families trying to keep meals nutritious without overspending.
    With a bit of creativity in the kitchen, these humble fish can become the stars
    of your table."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
