  m_text: "Ready to see this week's top games?\n\n3.) The Sun Wants to Kill Us\n\nA
    Survival Platformer originally developed for a Mini Game Jam event. The game
    is about a little alien with a watergun constaly descending into the planet to
    avoid the sun's rays. \n\n\n2.) Shimeji Escape\n\nA LoFi 2D Platformer with retro
    colors and pixel art. In the game, you play as a little shimeji caterpillar trying
    to escape a corrupted computer.\n\n\nTo see our top 1 choice, visit us at Game.io.com"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a984e2a6d5fd4c04fb81e9246af0897e, type: 2}
